@tejachavali thanks for spotting this. earlier i had `type(spec.tokens_per_state) != int` and ran tests through it. this was rejected during pre-commit checks, it then slipped through as `type(spec.tokens_per_state) is int` instead of `is not`.
ill get that fixed and go through other concerns as well.
thanks for the review!

